flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> A

    A["Step 1 - Get-GitHub-Directory-v2
    GET api.github.com/repos/{owner}/{repo}/contents/{path}
    X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2022-11-28  |  Auth: Basic"] --> B

    B["Step 2 - JSONPath Queries on Directory Response
    $.length()  -> NumberFiles
    $..name     -> GithubFileList array"] --> C

    C(["For each file in GithubFileList"]) --> D{File ==<br/>GITHUB-FILE<br/>settings.json?}
    D -->|No - skip| C
    D -->|Yes| E

    E["Step 3 - Get-GitHub-File-v2
    GET api.github.com/repos/{owner}/{repo}/contents/{path}/{file}
    Header: Accept: application/vnd.github.raw+json
    Returns: raw JSON content"] --> F

    F["Step 4a - JSONPath Queries on File Content
    $.length()  -> hierarchyLength
    $.project   -> ProjectJson full array"] --> G

    G["Step 4b - Read Table from JSON
    JSONPath: $.[*] -> HierarchyList table
    Columns: HierarchyParent | HierarchyArea
             HierarchyBldg   | HierarchyFloor"] --> H

    H(["For each row in HierarchyList"]) --> I

    I["Step 5a - Replace String + JSONPath Queries
    Extract 10 fields for current row:
    HierarchyParent, HierarchyArea, HierarchyBldg, HierarchyFloor
    HierarchyBldgAddress, cli_username
    snmp_v2c_read desc, snmp_v2c_write desc
    netconf_port, deviceDiscoveryList"] --> J1

    subgraph STEP5B["Step 5b - Resolved Discovery Inputs"]
        direction TB
        J1["HierarchyParent
        Parent area path root"] --> J2
        J2["HierarchyArea
        Area name for site lookup"] --> J3
        J3["HierarchyBldg + HierarchyBldgAddress
        Building name and address"] --> J4
        J4["HierarchyFloor
        Floor name within building"] --> J5
        J5["Device Credentials
        cli_username | snmp_v2c_read | snmp_v2c_write | netconf_port"] --> J6
        J6["deviceDiscoveryList
        Comma-separated IP list to discover"]
    end

    subgraph STEP5C["Step 5c - CATC-DeviceDiscovery-v3"]
        direction TB
        K1["1) GET /dna/intent/api/v2/global-credential
        Retrieve all global credentials snapshot"] --> K2
        K2["2) Extract UUIDs via JSONPath
        cliCredential by username    -> uuidCLI
        snmpV2cRead by description   -> uuidSNMPv2READ
        snmpV2cWrite by description  -> uuidSNMPv2WRITE
        netconfCredential by port    -> uuidNETCONF"] --> K3
        K3["3) GET /dna/intent/api/v1/dnac-release
        Determine installed Catalyst Center version"] --> K4
        K4["4) Python Data Transformation
        DiscoveryType: Range or Multi Range (by IP count)
        DeviceRange: ip-ip format (version-aware separator)
        siteNameHierarchy: Parent/Area/Bldg/Floor"] --> K5
        K5["5) GET /api/v1/discovery/1/100
        List existing discovery jobs"] --> K6
        K6["6) JSONPath: Find discovery by siteNameHierarchy name"] --> K7
        K7{Discovery<br/>already<br/>exists?} -->|No - error 400| K8A
        K7 -->|Yes - found| K8B

        K8A["7a) POST /dna/intent/api/v1/discovery
        Body: name, discoveryType, ipAddressList
        protocolOrder: ssh | timeout: 5 | retry: 3
        globalCredentialIdList: CLI, SNMPv2R, SNMPv2W, NETCONF
        Extract taskId from response"] --> K9

        K8B["7b) Extract existing discoveryId
        DELETE /dna/intent/api/v1/discovery/{id}
        Pause 8 seconds
        POST /dna/intent/api/v1/discovery (recreate)
        Extract taskId from response"] --> K9

        K9["8) Wait For Catalyst Center Task
        Poll task status every 5 seconds"] --> K10
        K10["9) GET /dna/intent/api/v1/task/{taskId}
        Extract discoveryId from task progress
        Sleep 180 seconds for discovery to complete"] --> K11
        K11["10) GET /dna/intent/api/v1/discovery/{id}/network-device
        Retrieve discovered devices
        Extract deviceUuid array + managementIpAddress list"] --> K12
        K12["11) GET /dna/intent/api/v2/site
        Query by groupNameHierarchy = siteNameHierarchy
        Extract siteId"] --> K13
        K13["12) Build Assign Request Body
        body: { deviceIds: [uuids], siteId: siteId }
        POST /dna/intent/api/v1/networkDevices/assignToSite/apply
        Assign discovered devices to target site"] --> K14
        K14["Return: discoveredDevices array + siteNameHierarchy"]
    end

    J6 --> K1
    K14 --> L{Discovery<br/>and assign<br/>result OK?}
    L -->|No| FAIL_A([Fail: CATC-DeviceDiscovery-v3<br/>returned error])
    L -->|Yes| M{More rows<br/>in HierarchyList?}

    M -->|Yes| H
    M -->|No| N

    N["Step 6 - Sleep 30 Seconds
    Allow Catalyst Center device inventory to settle"] --> DONE([Done])

    style FAIL_A fill:#c0392b,color:#fff,stroke:#922b21
    style DONE fill:#27ae60,color:#fff,stroke:#1e8449
    style START fill:#2980b9,color:#fff,stroke:#1a5276
